{"server":"cn","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_02_beg","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_02","title":"拓荒者小屋","storyCode":"DV-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"da7005886312f314659b19a81f307c56cbc96f6d7e0050f1bf63f2a009997a3a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"借着白面鸮晕倒而进入基地的赫默一行人与拓荒者们接触，就在僵局即将被打破之际，众人遭到神秘生物的袭击。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......先生，这是您下个月的保险费用账单。\n这么......多？\n我前几天才刚交过......\n那只能覆盖您这个月剩下几天的药费，而且按照规定，您必须在下个月一号之前去指定医疗机构完成体检。\n我......我的贷款还没下来......\n我在努力了，只要我把爸妈留下的熟食店抵押出去，就可以......\n先生，缴费截止日期就在明天。\n如果您无法按时交齐费用，只能说明您无力承担后续治疗产生的成本，出于对您的健康与社区安全的考虑，从下个月开始，您就只能搬去感染者收治区生活了。\n感染者......收治区？\n是的。\n请放心，在那里，您将会享受到更为优惠的公共医疗服务。\n不，我不想去......\n要是去了那里......\n我的人生就再没有其他出路了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生？领队先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是不太舒服吗？我听到您的呼吸很急促。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，我没有恶意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是和赫默医生一起进来的，您的队员们都检查过了，我们没有携带危险的武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。我只是出于习惯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您没必要道歉。我能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逐渐蔓延的黑暗会让人情绪紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要不要离我近一点？人多的地方会暖和一些，这样的话，就算忍不住睡过去了，也不至于会被冻僵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默医生的医疗无人机装配有应急电源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她正在屋子里为白面鸮小姐检查身体，埃琳娜小姐也和她们在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨姆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他听从您的安排，把身体不太好的拓荒者们都集中到室内了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想拜托你一件事。不要告诉萨姆和其他人，我刚刚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是领队，在这个节骨眼上，要是他们知道您体力不支，拓荒队内部可能会失控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不是想说拓荒队不够团结，只是......黑暗往往会催生变数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你很有经验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是玻利瓦尔人。在我过去生活的那座城市里，停电是常有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玻利瓦尔......战乱地区？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的家乡，我们很难说清楚，战火会在哪里暂时停下脚步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能从那个地方走出来，你很不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是同事们帮助了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看来，您和其他拓荒队的人更了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......了不起？哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您笑什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来那几家公司的广告已经一路打到玻利瓦尔去了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是这个意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，您靠自己的双腿走到了这里。而您的前辈们，那些来自维多利亚、高卢和玻利瓦尔的移民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是各位的足迹点亮了这片荒野。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......你还很会说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？我只是实话实说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在来之前，我就一直想看看哥伦比亚大名鼎鼎的拓荒区是什么模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你失望了吗？这里说不定比你的家乡还要荒凉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，领队先生，我还是学到了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如说，你们的电源线路设计果然和Mechanist先生说得一样，简洁且有效率啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警长，载具准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带上防具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚看见了，他们手上有自制手弩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等天更黑一点，派几架无人机先靠近拓荒者居住区，确认人质和匪徒各自所在位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们跟在后面，找个好时机攻进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......赫默研究员和那个罗德岛的干员呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不确定他们站在哪一边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是你们莱茵生命的做事方法吗？不管做什么事，都要先选边站？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是想确保问题得到解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警长，这就是防卫科的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我的职责是救人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听好，我不管你们想干什么，你们最好也不要妨碍我的工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，是罗德岛的人救了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛不仅仅救下了当时差点在事故中死去的我，还给了我继续学习的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能成长为现在的我，全靠罗德岛改变了我的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......真是一家不错的公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是眼下这情形，我会以为这是什么招聘宣讲会现场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......桑尼先生，要是您有这方面想法的话，真的可以向罗德岛投递简历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，一个拓荒者，现在恐怕还成了绑架犯......向你描述中这么好的公司投递简历？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别拿我开玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再怎么谦虚，我也能看出来，你是一个多么富有潜力的工程师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更别提你那三位同事......她们身为感染者，还能被莱茵生命雇佣，你知道这有多难吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......她们的确很优秀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不止是优秀。她们是万里挑一，在各自领域出类拔萃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每年有那么多感染者，只有极少数天才能得到“赦免”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是罗德岛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，格雷伊先生，你想说，“罗德岛救人的时候并没有那么严苛的条件”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我愿意相信你，相信你对救你一命的公司有特别的信心，相信它愿意违背自己追逐利益的天性，无差别地对待每一个感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是无法否认，你也是那个被选中的幸运儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的倒霉蛋，要么被圈养起来等着泥水没过头顶，要么只能试着走几步，冒着陷得更快的风险，找下一块能暂时落脚的弹丸之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......都和我一样，没人救我们，就连我们自己也不能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利维亚，你觉得这真的管用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔伊丝的脑电指标稳定一点了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给她注射了一些神经抑制剂，这是过去的常规治疗手段。虽然这次效果不是特别理想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道她病发另有诱因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她岂不是依然很危险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，解决不了诱因的话，她需要更好的监护环境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好......我本来也并不是在问乔伊丝的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你让格雷伊和拓荒者领队一起巡线......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我派他去的，格雷伊有自己的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是队长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在罗德岛本舰待的时间没有你们长，可我知道罗德岛是怎么行动的。奥利维亚，我不是想指责你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是格雷伊遭遇危险，或者乔伊丝的病情有所耽搁，你不会原谅你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，你觉得那位桑尼先生更容易相信格雷伊，还是我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有差别吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你是在一场莱茵总部的实验事故里不幸感染了矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时你有想过......以后可能再也做不了研究吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过很快，老板——我是说斐尔迪南就给我发了新的合同，把三年续成了十年，顺便涨了百分之三十的薪水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一年你还是莱茵年度优秀员工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......这不算安抚吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再怎么说，我在罗德岛治病的那些日子里，还给主任写完了三篇顶会论文啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你的想法，因为我也差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我远不及你乐观纯粹，我担忧过未来，也因此感激过帕尔维斯和莱茵生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我......我也从未怀疑过自己的天赋，以及我的天赋能带给莱茵生命的回报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病对我们来说是必须要克服的挑战，它不会蚕食全部的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这就是为何......格雷伊能做到我们都做不到的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼先生，我想指出，您说的话里有一些互相冲突的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说你们拓荒者是在冒着风险找下一块落脚之地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您怎么知道，往我们这边走一步，就不会是出路呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领队，你看屋子里——供电恢复了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，是你——你在跟我说话的同时，还在忙着做这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我当年没有跑进外面的黑暗里，就不可能遇上提着灯的罗德岛前辈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请相信我，有时候，再走一步真的有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算......我已经站在了悬崖边缘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哪怕您跳了下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们看到了您伸出来的手。您在向我们求救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就会尽一切努力抓住您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管您遭遇了什么，都还远远没到放弃的时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通电了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格雷伊......成功了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白面鸮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，乔伊丝对光亮有了反应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是你，直到此刻都这么专注。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......女士们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你一个人回来了？格雷伊呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前只有这一块区域通了电，他正在赶往另一片居住区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不信任我，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥利维亚，你说他不会相信我们的话，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更没有理由相信他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他把我和乔伊丝骗到了这里，而且我一直没说......我看见他们派了更多人围住了实验区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些拓荒者全都拿着武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情不是你想的那样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想的是什么样？你说你不想忘恩负义，难道你忘了多萝西是怎么对你们的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们却为了一己私欲想要伤害她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警报......你拉响了警报？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就想这么做了。警察和防卫科的同事们一定已经在路上，这下他们不必出动无人机确定我们的方位了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还得多谢格雷伊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是故意帮我们恢复供电......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别用你的阴暗心思揣测他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格雷伊是真的想帮助你们，就跟多萝西和乔伊丝一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在他们的分上，我也会考虑再放你一马。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领队，无论你们先前有什么打算，都趁早放弃吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g2_edgeofbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无人机已经出动了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵防卫科成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没有，我们的人在等您的指令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......基地里那些会飞的发光点是什么玩意？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g1_outdoorbase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差一点点，马上就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这光......好、好美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很美吗？谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......跟着您干了会活儿，连身体都更暖和了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来就只剩前面那个点了吧？让那些大公司的人见鬼去吧，只要我们的双手还能动，就休想用停止供给来威胁我们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对劲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不要再往前走了，那个光点并不是我的法术！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫默医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还想再问一次，你是不是真的愿意相信一名拓荒者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是医生，也是研究员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我的同事们一样——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们相信真相。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么有这么多人在跑动？是不是你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我没有让他们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，别过来啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是警察来救我们了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，别出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又发什么疯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜是那个东西又来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我本来想告诉你们的......真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，离门远一些！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领、领队......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......小......心......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是不是受伤了？还是......发病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别靠近他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的队员很明显需要帮助！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意他身后——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"形状不规则的物体悬在半空中。\n它的表面非常光滑，散发着柔和的银色光芒，此刻正微微起伏着，就如同顺应着某种呼吸的节奏。\n从拓荒者背后爬起来之后，它在空中停顿了大约三秒。\n随后，它缓慢地转动起自己的身躯，仿佛正好奇地挨个打量在场的人类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快跑！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
